{
  "version": 1,
  "meta": {
    "name": "deepseek-v3",
    "family": "deepseek",
    "notes": "Latent attention with a 576-wide cached vector per token per layer, three leading dense layers, then 58 sparse layers with 256 routed experts, eight active, plus one shared expert. The published figure excludes the multi-token-prediction module.",
